    {
      "id": "1",
      "text": "The Tokyo Tower is an iconic landmark and a must-visit attraction in Tokyo, offering panoramic views of the city from its observation decks.",
      "attributed_to": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "id": "2",
      "text": "The tower stands at 332.6 meters (1,091 feet) tall, making it one of the tallest towers in the world, and its design is inspired by the Eiffel Tower but with a more modern and sleek twist.",
      "attributed_to": "assistant"
